# Operator-local dashboard configuration — DASHENV-1.
#
# scripts/dashboard.sh sources this file (as .dashboard.env, the gitignored
# copy below) with allexport (`set -a`) at `start`, so every variable set
# here reaches the uvicorn process env. Sourcing OVERWRITES any
# caller-exported value: the file is durable operator intent, which is what
# makes provider routing survive a restart from a bare shell (see the
# 2026-09-08 incident where PIPELINE_BACKEND_CHAT=ollama was silently
# dropped and /api/chat + decompose fell back to the claude CLI default).
#
# To activate: copy this file to .dashboard.env (gitignored) and edit.
#    cp .dashboard.env.example .dashboard.env
#
# Provider routing (values are examples — see model_registry.json for the
# provider/model names your deployment supports):
#
# Backend serving /api/chat:
# PIPELINE_BACKEND_CHAT=ollama
#
# Backend serving decompose:
# PIPELINE_BACKEND_DECOMPOSE=ollama
#
# Default local model when a role does not pin one:
# PIPELINE_LOCAL_MODEL_DEFAULT=glm-5.3-flash:cloud